Agent Beacon (Asymptote Labs), https://github.com/Asymptote-Labs/agent-beacon, read at commit
99c709081ad49da1c5ade205929b61b19360ed9b.

adapters/beacon reads Agent Beacon's normalized runtime log (runtime.jsonl, schema_version 1.0). Its reader, the field
mapping in adapters/beacon/MAPPING.md and the synthetic test logs (tests/beacon_fixtures.py,
tests/fixtures/beacon/runtime.jsonl) follow the event schema described in Beacon's documentation
(docs/telemetry-schema/*.mdx) and its Go event types (pkg/asymptoteobserve/event.go): field names, action names and the
shape of an event. No Beacon program code is copied; the scrubber, the episode finder and the exporter were written for
